les\">Golden Doubloon</a></b></span></span><b>40</b>&#160;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip no-icon basic\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Stolen_Malachite.jpg/25px-Stolen_Malachite.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Stolen_Malachite.jpg 1.5x\" /></span></span> <span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Treasure_of_Crystal_Cove/Collectables#Stolen_Gems\" title=\"Treasure of Crystal Cove/Collectables\">Stolen Malachite</a></b></span></span> at <a href=\"/page/Dusty_Old_Treasure_of_Crystal_Cove\" title=\"Dusty Old Treasure of Crystal Cove\">Dusty Old Treasure of Crystal Cove</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Enhancements\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/page/Upgradeable_-_Tier_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Upgradeable - Tier 1\">Upgradeable - Tier 1</a>\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+6 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+6 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +6 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Armor_Class\" title=\"Armor Class\">Armor Class</a>, <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack</a> and <a href=\"/page/Damage_roll\" title=\"Damage roll\">damage rolls</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;toolti