itle=\"Riposte\">Riposte VIII</a>:</b> When Missed by an attack: Deals 8 to 32 damage to your attacker. Passive: +4 <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Armor_Class\" title=\"Armor Class\">Armor Class</a>, +4 <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Fortitude\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude\">Fortitude</a>, <a href=\"/page/Reflex\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex\">Reflex</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Will\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Will\">Will</a> <a href=\"/page/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>.</span></span> &#8594; <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Riposte\" title=\"Riposte\">Riposte X</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Riposte\" title=\"Riposte\">Riposte X</a>:</b> When Missed by an attack: Deals 10 to 40 damage to your attacker. Passive: +5 <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Armor_Class\" title=\"Armor Class\">Armor Class</a>, +5 <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Fortitude\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude\">Fortitude</a>, <a href=\"/page/Reflex\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex\">Reflex</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Will\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Will\">Will</a> <a href=\"/page/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li>Adds <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">I